# Local design-intelligence tooling: `uipro init --ai claude` generates a
# design-system/ query cache. That stays local — it is regenerated output,
# not portal source.
#
# `.claude/skills/` used to be ignored here on the same grounds. It no longer
# is: the skills under it are checked in on purpose (see
# .claude/skills/VENDORED.md) and were already tracked despite the rule, so
# the rule only meant new skills went missing from git in silence.
